{"id": "34092", "title": "兼职老婆(婚姻急诊室3)", "author": "艾蜜莉", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34092/34092s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34092.htm", "intro": "身为“星颐电影公司”中名声响当当的金牌制片家，安至雍可是男人欣羡、女人心目中的黄金单身汉，想当然尔，他对踏入婚姻的坟墓这事是没多大兴趣的，然而，可恶的老爸却为了一逞个人抱孙的私欲，竟罔顾他的自由，以公司的股份和经营权逼他结婚，迫于无奈，他找上没心机、不黏人的青梅竹马温语涵，本以为他条件这么优，只要一开口，她肯定立即点头，岂料他都纡尊降贵地求婚了，她却毫不犹豫地拒绝他！啧，都怪他“前科累累”，自小老爱整她种下了祸根，不过没关系，山不转路转！以为他会这么轻易放弃吗？月薪三万、三节奖金，外加治装费、演出费及赡养费，条件这么诱人，就不信这穷得要命的女人会不答应嫁！", "base": "files/article/html/34/34092", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2168779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2168780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2168781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2168782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2168783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2168784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2168785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2168786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2168787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2168788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2168789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2168790.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2168791.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2168792.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2168793.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2168794.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2168795.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2168796.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2168797.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2168798.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2168799.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2168800.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2168801.html", "available": 